{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"se4551ccb50c527a9","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-npc-p11525-6e2cd511f10a7a4d3e75","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"se4551ccb50c527a9","text":"더 이상은——못.참.아!!!","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"분노","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["17888249967410645304"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-a890bfa677f0d4c68957","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"se4551ccb50c527a9","text":"앞에 있던 「시계 소년」은 숨을 거칠게 몰아쉬었다. 납작한 다이얼과 가는 두 다리는 두 시 반의 각도로 팽팽하게 당겨졌고, 무거운 「시침」은 눈금 사이에서 이리저리 흔들리고 있다","speaker":"","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"분노","type":"narration","textHashCandidates":["11580185063237980009"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-526ce3694f7cf3e9ddfa","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"se4551ccb50c527a9","text":"툭하면 「자발적 야근」이니 「반년 치 성과급 차감」이니… 우리가 하루 종일 뼈 빠지게 일해서 버는 알팔파 크레딧에서 호텔 숙박비를 빼면 시계 피자도 못 산다고!","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"분노","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["15584313613412886837"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-b82977886d440d773d69","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"se4551ccb50c527a9","text":"그래, 우린 시계 소년을 좋아해. 좋아하면 좀 손해볼 수도 있지만, 그렇다고 우릴 착취해도 되는 건 아니야! 스톤 보스도 나쁜 짓을 하기 전에는 「그럴싸한 이유」를 찾는다고!","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"분노","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["16895132375753971739"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-908ad99672d12c6aae71","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"se4551ccb50c527a9","text":"…애니메이션은… 애니메이션은 사람들에게 즐거움을 줘야 하는 거 아닌가?","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"분노","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["4703433525137922067"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-01131ec46baa6752c536","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"se4551ccb50c527a9","text":"근데 어째서 「좋은꿈 마을」에 온 뒤부터 오히려 더 즐겁지 않은 거지……?","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"분노","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["8624596620212138160"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-94f3b390b4d6e4d62b93","entryId":"other-npc-p11525","chapterId":"se4551ccb50c527a9","text":"좋은꿈 마을은 아름답고 평화… 롭기는 개뿔!","speaker":"「시계 소년」","mission":"「시계 소년」","scene":"분노","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["13560012049413838073"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3528042516920741898","8054576472749388139","10243348632095039658"],"speakerUnresolved":false}],"wikiReading":{"schema":"hsr-wiki-reading.v1","missions":[{"id":"npc-p11525","title":"「시계 소년」","page":"「钟表小子」","officialMissionIds":[]}],"occurrences":[{"id":"other-npc-p11525-6e2cd511f10a7a4d3e75","rowId":"other-npc-p11525-6e2cd511f10a7a4d3e75","missionId":"npc-p11525","mission":"「시계 소년」","sceneId":"se4551ccb50c527a9","scene":"분노","contextId":"wiki-context-d66c43a0b39721fe22750f85","page":"「钟表小子」","revision":64190,"location":[0,0],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":[],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-a890bfa677f0d4c68957","rowId":"other-npc-p11525-a890bfa677f0d4c68957","missionId":"npc-p11525","mission":"「시계 소년」","sceneId":"se4551ccb50c527a9","scene":"분노","contextId":"wiki-context-b9586eff793de9b40f19cbcb","page":"「钟表小子」","revision":64190,"location":[1,0],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":[],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-npc-p11525-526ce3694f7cf3e9ddfa","rowId":"other-npc-p11525-526ce3694f7cf3e9ddfa","missionId":"npc-p11525","mission":"「시계 소년」","sceneId":